Package: nirs4all
Type: Package
Title: Composable Near-Infrared Spectroscopy Pipelines for R
Version: 0.4.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Gregory", "Beurier", email = "gregory.beurier@cirad.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("nirs4all", "contributors", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides an R-facing pipeline API for near-infrared spectroscopy.
    Composes portable preprocessing and partial least squares operations from
    'n4m' with explicit R learner controllers. This development version offers
    local fit, predict, portable 'n4m' model serialization, and a native
    'dagml' cross-validation, refit and replay path for single-model pipelines.
    Branching DAGs and host hyperparameter search remain under development.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all-r
BugReports: https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all-r/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: n4m, stats
Suggests: dagml, digest, glmnet, jsonlite, ranger, torch
Additional_repositories: https://gbeurier.r-universe.dev
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: no
